sequenceDiagram
    %% SD2 - Manage account and family membership
    %% Stories: 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 51, 52, 53, 54, 58, 59
    %% Description: A customer views and changes personal, payment and notification settings, and manages the persons on a family membership.
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    participant CU as Customer
    participant PI as PaymentInformation
    participant FM as FamilyMembership
    participant PE as Person

    %% covers 58, 59
    CP->>CU: view personal and membership information
    %% covers 10
    CP->>CU: change personal details
    %% covers 11
    CP->>CU: update payment information
    CU->>PI: payment information
    %% covers 51, 52, 53, 54
    CP->>CU: set notification preferences
    %% covers 9
    CP->>CU: reset password
    %% covers 12
    CP->>CU: see who uses the family membership
    %% covers 13, 14
    CP->>CU: add or remove a person
    CU->>FM: family membership
    FM->>PE: person
